Private network (PrivateLink / Business Critical) note

If you need the Snowflake account to connect to Bitbucket over a private network (not public internet), you must configure PrivateLink / outbound private connectivity in your Snowflake account (Business Critical or higher) and configure the cloud provider side. The authentication model (secret with x-token-auth + PAT) remains the same, but network setup is more involved. See Snowflake PrivateLink + Git integration guidance. 
